// cancelled DURING sleep/prepare (outside shield) -> unwinds there, prints:
//   winner: 7
//   ledger closed
//   group done
// cancelled DURING the shielded commit -> commit finishes first, then unwinds:
//   winner: 7
//   committed
//   ledger closed
//   group done
